      text = "Mira has a new school. She has a small bag and a red book.\n\nThe school is near a park. A teacher opens the door. \"Good morning, Mira. Come in.\"\n\nMira sees a cat in the garden. The cat is black and white. She says, \"I have a book for the class.\" The teacher smiles. \"Thank you. Please sit near the window.\" Mira sits down. She is happy.",
